Use the Project Rules in `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`.

- Next.js App Router with React Server Components by default
- TypeScript strict; avoid `any` and prefer `zod`-validated types
- Prisma + PostgreSQL; use explicit selects; validate inputs at boundaries
- tRPC for API; cohesive routers; SuperJSON for complex types
- Tailwind + shadcn/ui + Radix; accessible and responsive UI

For onboarding, see `.cursor/context/overview.md`.
